flowchart LR
    Change[Contributor or agent change] --> Index[Git index]
    Index --> Hooks[Pre-push hook]
    Hooks --> All[Run deterministic, Presidio, phi-scan, HoundDog, OCR, and DICOM tools]
    All --> Findings{Clean or reviewed?}
    Findings -->|yes| Push[Push]
    Findings -->|no or tool missing| Block[Block]
    Push --> CI[CI reruns all permitted scanners]
    CI --> Merge[Merge]
